  "cff-version": "1.2.0",
  "message": "Please cite this software using the repository URL and exact commit, plus the method, software and data references actually used. Cite Julián Andrés Ascencio Vásquez's doctoral thesis for work derived from it; it inspired the project and its early studies, while later additions have their own scientific sources.",
  "title": "energy-data-insights",
  "type": "software",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "energy-data-insights contributors"
    }
  ],
  "repository-code": "https://github.com/julianascencio/energy-data-insights",
  "references": [
    {
      "type": "thesis",
      "title": "Modelling and worldwide assessment of performance and aging of photovoltaic modules and systems",
      "authors": [
        {
          "family-names": "Ascencio Vásquez",
          "given-names": "Julián Andrés"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://www.dlib.si/details/URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9",
      "notes": "Role: foundational. Project inspiration and scientific foundation for the early studies and methods. Later additions include independent methods, connectors, databases and applications with their own sources; this thesis is not the source of every repository component. University of Ljubljana catalogue: COBISS 77808131; national-library URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9. Defended 21 September 2021. Marko Topič is the advisor, not a coauthor. No thesis DOI has been verified. Citation does not claim that every thesis chapter is implemented. CCYA implementation follows sections 7.5.1–7.5.3 (pp. 150–164), with equations 3.6/3.8 for thermal context. The institutional full text is https://repozitorij.uni-lj.si/Dokument.php?id=148326&lang=eng. Explicit choices for monthly centroid scaling, incremental temperature normalization, nonexceedance quantiles and cumulative ratio versus signed gain are documented in docs/ccya.md; no numerical reproduction of Bolzano is claimed. Soiling and snow indicators follow Eqs. 3.2–3.4 (pp. 49–51) and Tables 6.6–6.7 (pp. 135–136), with explicit equality/low-domain conventions and alternative example data documented in docs/soiling-snow.md.",
      "year": 2021,
      "institution": {
        "name": "University of Ljubljana, Faculty of Electrical Engineering"
      },
      "thesis-type": "Doctoral dissertation"
    },
    {
