      "url": "https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/13/9/2166",
      "notes": "Role: implemented. Source of the two-stage irradiance/power acceptance band and low/medium/high irradiance evidence levels. The repository states its interpretation of inconsistent printed roughness/distance expressions. Chronological validation and monotonic LightGBM settings are project adaptations. The solar/wind forecasting benchmark uses this paper as methodological inspiration for resource-quality disclosure and empirical/ML comparison, not numerical reproduction. Rolling forecasts, XGBoost, Timestral and wind are project extensions; its acceptance-band algorithm and test-outlier removal are not applied in this benchmark.",
